<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ariadne Professional Penetration Test Report</title>
<style>
{{ css_text }}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="report-container">

<header class="cover-page">
  <div class="cover-mark">ARIADNE</div>
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ profile | upper }} / AUTHORIZED SECURITY ASSESSMENT</p>
  <h1>Penetration Test Report</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Evidence-backed technical and executive report</p>
  <table class="meta-table">
    <tr><th>Classification</th><td>{{ classification }}</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Version</th><td>{{ report_version }}</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Report date</th><td>{{ generated_at[:10] }}</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Engagement ID</th><td><code>{{ engagement_id }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Target{% if targets | length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</th><td>{% for t in targets %}<code>{{ t.host }}</code>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p class="cover-note">Prepared from the immutable engagement dossier. Authorized use only.</p>
</header>

<nav class="toc page">
  <p class="eyebrow">REPORT NAVIGATION</p>
  <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#executive-summary">Executive Summary</a></li>
    <li><a href="#scope">Scope, Objectives, and Methodology</a></li>
    <li><a href="#assessment-overview">Assessment Overview</a></li>
    <li><a href="#attack-path">Timeline and Attack Path</a></li>
    <li><a href="#technical-findings">Technical Findings</a></li>
    <li><a href="#evidence-register">Evidence Register</a></li>
    <li><a href="#objectives">Objective Evidence / Flags</a></li>
    <li><a href="#cleanup">Cleanup and Limitations</a></li>
    <li><a href="#conclusions">Conclusions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#appendices">Appendices</a></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>Evidence policy.</strong> {{ disclaimer }}
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
<section id="executive-summary" class="page executive-summary">
  <p class="eyebrow">01 / EXECUTIVE VIEW</p>
  <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
  <p class="lead">{{ executive_summary }}</p>

  <div class="summary-grid">
    <div class="metric">
      <span class="metric-value">{{ validated_findings | length }}</span>
      <span class="metric-label">Validated findings</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <span class="metric-value">{{ evidence | length }}</span>
      <span class="metric-label">Deduplicated artifacts</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <span class="metric-value">{{ compromise_narrative | length }}</span>
      <span class="metric-label">Evidence-backed steps</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Highest-priority observations</h3>
  <ul class="priority-list">
  {% for f in validated_findings %}
    <li><span class="severity-badge severity-{{ f.severity or 'unspecified' }}">{{ f.severity or "unspecified" }}</span> <strong>{{ f.title }}</strong>{% if f.impact %} — {{ f.impact }}{% endif %}</li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="scope" class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">02 / ENGAGEMENT CONTRACT</p>
  <h2>Scope, Objectives, and Methodology</h2>
  <div class="two-column">
    <div>
      <h3>In-scope assets</h3>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Asset</th><th>Profile</th><th>Intensity</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for t in targets %}
          <tr><td><code>{{ t.host }}</code></td><td>{{ profile }}</td><td>{{ intensity }}</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Objectives</h3>
      <ul class="status-list">
      {% for o in objectives %}
        <li><span class="status-dot {% if o.completed %}complete{% endif %}"></span><strong>{{ o.kind | replace("_", " ") | title }}</strong>: {{ o.description }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Methodology</h3>
  <p>{{ methodology }}</p>
  <p>The workflow remained evidence-driven: each target-facing transition required a persisted observation from the preceding step, and policy constraints remained the maximum permissible boundary.</p>

  <h3>Limitations and exclusions</h3>
  {% if exclusions %}
  <ul>{% for exclusion in exclusions %}<li>{{ exclusion }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  {% else %}
  <p>No additional exclusions were persisted.</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>No screenshots were acquired during this run. This report references the actual textual and binary artifacts retained in the dossier and does not fabricate visual evidence.</p>
</section>

<section id="assessment-overview" class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">03 / RISK OVERVIEW</p>
  <h2>Assessment Overview</h2>
  <h3>Risk Summary</h3>
  <table class="risk-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Severity</th><th>Validated findings</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Critical</td><td>{{ risk_counts.critical }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>High</td><td>{{ risk_counts.high }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Medium</td><td>{{ risk_counts.medium }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Low</td><td>{{ risk_counts.low }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Informational</td><td>{{ risk_counts.informational }}</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Finding summary</h3>
  <table class="findings-table">
    <thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Finding</th><th>Severity</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% if findings %}
    {% for f in findings %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ f.finding_id or ("finding-" ~ loop.index) }}</code></td>
        <td>{{ f.title }}</td>
        <td><span class="severity-badge severity-{{ f.severity or 'unspecified' }}">{{ f.severity or "unspecified" }}</span></td>
        <td>{{ f.status }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
      <tr><td colspan="4">No reportable findings were persisted.</td></tr>
    {% endif %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="small">{{ scoring_notes }}</p>
</section>

<section id="attack-path" class="page attack-path">
  <p class="eyebrow">04 / TECHNICAL NARRATIVE</p>
  <h2>Timeline and Attack Path</h2>
  <h3>Compromise Narrative</h3>
  {% if compromise_narrative %}
  <table class="timeline-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Time (UTC)</th><th>Phase</th><th>Observed transition</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for step in compromise_narrative %}
      <tr><td><code>{{ step.timestamp }}</code></td><td>{{ step.phase | replace("_", " ") | title }}</td><td>{{ step.result }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="attack-chain">
  {% for step in compromise_narrative %}
    <article class="attack-step" id="{{ step.step_id }}">
      <div class="step-marker">{{ "%02d" | format(loop.index) }}</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-phase">{{ step.phase | replace("_", " ") | upper }} · {{ step.timestamp }}</p>
        <h3>{{ step.action }}</h3>
        <dl>
          <dt>Prerequisite</dt><dd>{% if step.prerequisites %}{{ step.prerequisites | join("; ") }}{% else %}No additional prerequisite persisted.{% endif %}</dd>
          <dt>Evidence-derived input</dt><dd>{{ step.input }}</dd>
        </dl>
        <h4>Command / action</h4>
        {% if step.commands %}
          {% for command in step.commands %}<pre><code>{{ command }}</code></pre>{% endfor %}
        {% else %}
          <p>No target-facing command was required for this persisted transition.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <h4>Result</h4>
        <p>{{ step.result }}</p>
        <h4>Interpretation</h4>
        <p>{{ step.interpretation }}</p>
        <h4>Evidence</h4>
        {% if step.evidence %}
        <ul class="evidence-links">
        {% for name in step.evidence %}
          <li><code>{{ name }}</code>{% if evidence_by_name.get(name) %} — {{ evidence_by_name[name].caption }}{% endif %}</li>
        {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% else %}
        <p>Persisted lifecycle event; no separate artifact was required.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <p class="next-step"><strong>Link to next step:</strong> {{ step.next_step_id or "engagement objectives and cleanup complete" }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p>No compromise lifecycle was persisted.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="technical-findings" class="technical-findings">
  <p class="eyebrow">05 / VALIDATED FINDINGS</p>
  <h2>Technical Findings</h2>
  {% if findings %}
  {% for f in findings %}
  <article class="finding-detail page" id="{{ f.finding_id or ('finding-' ~ loop.index) }}">
    <div class="finding-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">FINDING {{ "%02d" | format(loop.index) }}</p>
        <h3>{{ f.title }}</h3>
      </div>
      <span class="severity-badge large severity-{{ f.severity or 'unspecified' }}">{{ f.severity or "unspecified" }}</span>
    </div>
    <table class="finding-meta">
      <tr><th>Status</th><td>{{ f.status }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Affected asset</th><td>{% if f.affected_assets %}{% for asset in f.affected_assets %}<code>{{ asset }}</code>{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% elif f.target %}<code>{{ f.target }}</code>{% else %}Not persisted{% endif %}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>CWE</th><td>{{ f.cwe or "Not assigned" }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>CVSS 3.1</th><td>{% if f.cvss_score is not none %}<strong>{{ f.cvss_score }}</strong> · {% endif %}<code>{{ f.cvss_vector or "Not assigned" }}</code></td></tr>
    </table>

    <h4>Description and root cause</h4>
    <p>{{ f.description or "No description was persisted for this finding." }}</p>

    <h4>Prerequisites</h4>
    {% if f.prerequisites %}<ul>{% for item in f.prerequisites %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p>No additional prerequisites were persisted.</p>{% endif %}

    <h4>Reproduction</h4>
    {% if f.procedure %}
    <ol>{% for item in f.procedure %}<li>Follow attack-path step <a href="#{{ item }}">{{ item }}</a>.</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
    {% else %}<p>No reproducible procedure was persisted.</p>{% endif %}

    <h4>Evidence</h4>
    {% if f.evidence %}
    <ul class="evidence-links">
    {% for name in f.evidence %}
      <li><code>{{ name }}</code>{% if evidence_by_name.get(name) %} — {{ evidence_by_name[name].caption }}; SHA-256 <code>{{ evidence_by_name[name].sha256 }}</code>{% endif %}</li>
    {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}<p>No separate evidence artifact was linked.</p>{% endif %}

    <h4>Impact</h4>
    <p>{{ f.impact or "No independently supported impact was persisted." }}</p>

    <h4>Remediation</h4>
    {% if f.remediation %}<ol>{% for item in f.remediation %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol>{% else %}<p>No remediation action was persisted.</p>{% endif %}
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
  <p>No reportable findings were persisted.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="evidence-register" class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">06 / ARTIFACTS</p>
  <h2>Evidence Register</h2>
  <p>Artifacts are listed once by content digest. Captions describe the persisted observation; excerpts are bounded and redacted.</p>
  {% if evidence %}
  <table class="evidence-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Artifact and caption</th><th>Type</th><th>Bytes</th><th>SHA-256</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for e in evidence %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ e.filename }}</code><br><span class="caption">{{ e.caption }}</span></td>
        <td>{{ e.evidence_type or "unspecified" }}</td>
        <td>{{ e.size_bytes }}</td>
        <td><code class="digest">{{ e.sha256 }}</code></td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% else %}
  <p>No event-backed evidence artifacts were persisted.</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if evidence_excerpts %}
  <h3>Selected textual evidence</h3>
  {% for e in evidence_excerpts %}
  <figure class="artifact-preview">
    <figcaption><strong>Artifact {{ loop.index }}.</strong> {{ e.caption }} — <code>{{ e.filename }}</code></figcaption>
    <pre><code>{{ e.excerpt }}</code></pre>
  </figure>
  {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="objectives" class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">07 / OUTCOME</p>
  <h2>Objective Evidence / Flags</h2>
  <div class="objective-cards">
  {% for o in objectives %}
    <article class="objective-card {% if o.completed %}complete{% endif %}">
      <h3>{% if o.kind == "user_flag" %}User flag{% elif o.kind == "root_flag" %}Root flag{% else %}{{ o.kind | replace("_", " ") | title }}{% endif %}</h3>
      <p>{{ o.description }}</p>
      <p class="objective-status">{% if o.completed %}Achieved{% else %}Not completed{% endif %}</p>
      {% if o.flag_value %}
      <p class="flag-value"><code>{{ o.flag_value }}</code></p>
      {% elif o.completion_evidence %}
        {% if o.kind in ["user_flag", "root_flag"] and not o.flag_value_available %}
        <p>Value unavailable: this historical run persisted only the proof hash, so the flag cannot be recovered from the dossier.</p>
        <p>Proof SHA-256: <code>{{ o.completion_evidence }}</code></p>
        {% elif o.kind in ["user_flag", "root_flag"] %}
        <p>Flag captured; value hidden by report options.</p>
        <p>Proof SHA-256: <code>{{ o.completion_evidence }}</code></p>
        {% else %}
        <p>Proof SHA-256: <code>{{ o.completion_evidence }}</code></p>
        {% endif %}
      {% endif %}
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <h3>Proven access</h3>
  {% if compromised %}
  <ul>{% for c in compromised %}<li>{{ c }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  {% else %}
  <p>No access state was proven by the persisted dossier.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="cleanup" class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">08 / CLOSEOUT</p>
  <h2>Cleanup and Limitations</h2>
  <h3>Cleanup verification</h3>
  {% if cleanup %}<ul>{% for item in cleanup %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p>No cleanup verification was persisted.</p>{% endif %}

  <h3>Screenshot evidence</h3>
  {% if screenshots %}
  <ul>{% for screenshot in screenshots %}<li><code>{{ screenshot.filename }}</code> — {{ screenshot.caption }} — SHA-256 <code>{{ screenshot.sha256 }}</code></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  {% else %}
  <p>No screenshots were acquired during this run. The absence is a collection limitation, not evidence that no observable behavior occurred.</p>
  {% endif %}

  <h3>Tool outcome semantics</h3>
  <p>A successful tool execution with zero matches is reported as “no finding.” A timeout, adapter error, or unavailable tool is reported as an execution limitation and is not converted into a negative security conclusion. The attack path records the Katana and ZAP outcomes independently from the bounded curl fallback.</p>
</section>

<section id="conclusions" class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">09 / CONCLUSION</p>
  <h2>Conclusions</h2>
  <p class="lead">{{ conclusion }}</p>

  <h3>Remediation priorities</h3>
  {% if remediation %}
  <ol>{% for r in remediation %}<li>{{ r }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
  {% else %}
  <p>No remediation actions were persisted.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="appendices" class="page appendices">
  <p class="eyebrow">10 / APPENDICES</p>
  <h2>Appendices</h2>
  <h3>Scoring notes</h3>
  <p>{{ scoring_notes }}</p>
  <h3>Evidence integrity</h3>
  <p>Every artifact in the evidence register was resolved below the engagement artifact directory and re-hashed during dossier construction. Duplicate contents were collapsed by SHA-256.</p>
  <h3>Report provenance</h3>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Engagement ID</th><td><code>{{ engagement_id }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Generated</th><td>{{ generated_at }}</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Classification</th><td>{{ classification }}</td></tr>
  </table>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <span>Ariadne · Authorized use only</span>
  <span>Engagement <code>{{ engagement_id }}</code></span>
</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
